 of childhood onset type-1 diabetic patients</article-title>.<source>Nephrol Dial Transplant</source><year>2001</year>;<volume>16</volume>:<fpage>1382</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1386</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11427629</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rudberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Persson</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Dahlquist</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Increased glomerular filtration rate as a predictor of diabetic nephropathy&#x02014;an 8-year prospective study</article-title>.<source>Kidney Int</source><year>1992</year>;<volume>41</volume>:<fpage>822</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>828</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1513104</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Steinke</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sinaiko</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kramer</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Suissa</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chavers</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Mauer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group>:<collab>International Diabetic Nephropathy Study Group</collab><article-title>The early natural history of nephropathy in type 1 diabetes: III. Predictors of 5-year urinary albumin excretion rate patterns in initially normoalbuminuric patients</article-title>.<source>Diabetes</source><year>2005</year>;<volume>54</volume>:<fpage>2164</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2171</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15983218</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yip</surname><given-names>JW</given-nam